local macro "⊠" : term => `(term| IsPullback.of_horiz_isIso .mk)

/- The equivalence data coming from an isomorphism `e : c₀ ≌ c₁` and the base change isomorphism.
This contains the data of an adjunction `P.u e.hom ⊣ P.v e.hom`.
